# Barbed Bloodletter's enter trigger attaches it to a creature Bot1 controls, chosen as the trigger goes on the stack: Bot2's
# Ornithopter is refused, Bot1's own Ornithopter taken (1/4 equipped). Its equip {2} (CR 702.6a, sorcery speed) then moves it to the
# Memnite for exactly {2}: the Memnite is a 2/3, the Ornithopter a 0/2 again, and nothing is left in the pool.

[Bot1 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Barbed Bloodletter
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

